title: "Algorithmic procurement for an electricity retailer in MIBEL"
abstract: >-
  Code for an MSc Business Analytics thesis (Católica Lisbon School of Business and
  Economics). Load and price forecasting, day-ahead/intraday market routing, procurement
  cost simulation and a rule-based battery add-on for a Portuguese electricity retailer.
